        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SWP4740, Triple Rocker Cover</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPut the finishing touches on your home with a triple rocker switch or outlet plate. It is available in 8 finishes including matte black, satin nickel and rubbed oil bronze. This solid brass triple rocker switch cover is used with Decora style electrical outlets or switches and is made by Deltana to provide the perfect accent to your home or office.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SWP4740.gif?v=1704354779\" width=\"450\" height=\"317\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana SWP4740 Triple Switch Plate Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/single-rocker-solid-brass-plate-deltana-swp4754\"><b>Single Switch Plate</b></a> - <a href=\"/products/double-rocker-cover-deltana-swp4741\"><b>Double Switch Plate</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/quadruple-rocker-cover-deltana-swp4744\"><b>Quad Switch Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana SWP4740 Triple Rocker Cover:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Switch Hole Length: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Switch Hole Width:1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Hole Spacing Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Hole Spacing Width: 1-3/4\"center to center</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SWP4740-specifications.pdf?v=1704262299\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SWP4740 Triple Rocker Cover Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
